OL,3,GNEWSATwo babies in hospital after
OL,4,Asix-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo babies and three adults were taken
OL,7,Fto hospital after six vehicles crashed
OL,8,Fat the end of an A14 slip-road in
OL,9,FSuffolk.
OL,11,FIt happened at the Claydon junction at
OL,12,Fabout 17:30 GMT on Tuesday, causing the
OL,13,Fwestbound carriageway to be closed
OL,14,Fbetween junctions 52 and 51.
OL,16,FSuffolk's fire service said crews found
OL,17,Ftwo separate but related crashes, with
OL,18,Fone involving four vehicles that had
OL,19,Fcollided end-to-end containing five
OL,20,Fadults and two babies.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
