OL,3,GNEWSATwo babies in hospital after
OL,4,Asix-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo adults were involved in the other
OL,7,Fcrash, but they were uninjured and able
OL,8,Fto drive away from the scene, said the
OL,9,Fservice. The road reopened later in the
OL,10,Fevening.
